      248.45,
      401.9,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "(iii) Subsections (2D) and (2E) of section 28 of the PrincipalEnactment, as amended by subsection 8 and 9 of theLocal Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16of 2017 are hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
